<title>CHILE: Chile's Edelnor first half net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile's Edelnor first half net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean power generator</p>
<p>Compania Electrica del Norte Grande, Edelnor, reported the</p>
<p>following results in the first quarter.</p>
<p>				 H1 1997	  H1 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		    5.42	     1.20</p>
<p> Operating profi	     4.01	     0.57</p>
<p> Non-operating profit	2.17	     0.84</p>
<p> Total revenues	     23.42	    23.00</p>
<p>NOTE: 1. All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>	 2. Southern Electric owns 65 percent of Edelnor.</p>
<p>(( --Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
